# Test scene for new transition features

# Test background with transition
@bg school transition dissolve
K: Testing background transition with dissolve effect.

# Test sprite with new transition syntax (quoted)
@sprite kuro transition="fadein"
K: Testing sprite transition with quoted fadein effect.

# Test sprite with new transition syntax (unquoted)
@sprite kuro transition dissolve
K: Testing sprite transition with unquoted dissolve effect.

# Test sprite with position and transition
@sprite kuro position="left" transition="dissolve"
K: Testing sprite with position and quoted dissolve transition.

# Test sprite with position and unquoted transition
@sprite kuro position="right" transition fadein
K: Testing sprite with position and unquoted fadein transition.

# Test that old animation syntax still works
@sprite kuro position="center" animation="fadeout"
K: Testing that old animation syntax still works.

# Test background transition to different background
@bg black transition dissolve
K: Changed to black background with dissolve transition.

